00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:08.580
<i>and feeling like I was in the future</i>

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:14.090
<i>I felt completely in sync with your wind</i>

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:23.050
<i>I finally found a place where I could be a girl</i>

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:17.850
Let's start with speeding it up.

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:19.420
Then we have to reinforce the barriers.

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:25.460
If we can stabilize Freyja's singing, that'd help Mikumo too.

00:19:23.530 --> 00:19:30.770
<i>so I've got no choice but to do it. I can't stop now!</i>

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:32.270
You better be ready!

