00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:49.340
I don't really know what's the right thing to do,

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:54.410
but I can cheer up the galaxy with my singing.

00:20:58.390 --> 00:20:59.630
Messer?

00:20:59.630 --> 00:21:04.030
