00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:09.280
Return to base immediately or this will be 
considered mutiny and you will be shot down.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.720
Shot down?

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:13.910
Chill out, man. I just—

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:15.960
He locked onto us?!

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:23.720
What are you doing, Lt. Mirage?

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:29.220
You noticed Sgt. Hayate's actions and hoped to stop him before I did?

00:21:30.070 --> 00:21:30.930
How naive.

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:33.350
I'm sorry.

00:21:33.700 --> 00:21:35.230
What?

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:36.770
