00:21:42.910 --> 00:21:47.410
Freyja Wion, I'm going to inform 
Kaname about your actions today.

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:51.810
Freyja and Mirage have nothing to do with this.

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:54.320
That sounds right. It's your fault.

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:56.870
We don't need someone like you.

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:01.340
War has begun. Screwing around will not be overlooked.

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:03.530
If you don't like that, get out of here.

00:22:17.330 --> 00:22:18.310
I've made up my mind.

00:22:19.630 --> 00:22:22.120
I'll stay with the Delta Platoon.

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:29.360
If you're telling me I can't fly how I want to because we're at war,

00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:31.350
then I'll just end it.

00:22:32.740 --> 00:22:37.620
I'll end the war and free up the skies with these hands.

00:22:39.140 --> 00:22:43.210
Those are some big words for 
someone who can't even fly properly.

